      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ABOVE THEM ALL (4) ran below best last time finishing sixth (16.77) over 300m at Healesville from Box 8. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from two starts. Has ability and looks hard to stop. MARSHAL LEE ROSE (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (35.16) in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Deserves plenty of respect. NARINGAL LAD (6) goes very well this trip starting 12 times for four wins and five minors. Comes off a (30.26) win last time, scoring by 1.4 lengths in a Grade 5 over 525m at The Meadows. Among the main chances. NO STOP SIGNS (8) is always hard to beat when he races at this trip.",
